# What the Docker build may see: an ALLOW-list, so secrets (.env files,
# certificates), local data and build leftovers can never end up in an image.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!scripts/
!apps/api/
!apps/app/
!packages/
# The website isn't in the image, but pnpm needs its package.json to match the lockfile
!apps/site/package.json

# ...and never these, even inside the folders above
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.crt
**/*.pem
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
apps/api/test
